      "section": "QC overview",
      "order": 2,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "MultiQC aggregates the per-sample FastQC and Cutadapt reports for this run. The four panels here answer the questions asked first: how many reads survived trimming, how evenly they are spread across samples, and whether base quality holds to the end of the read. The remaining ten panels are folded into *QC details* below. Pick a sample on the left to narrow every panel at once.",
      "wf_tag": "nextflow/ampliseq"
    },
